3. Add `ChatPart` — discriminated union on `kind`:
   - `text`: `{ kind: "text", text: str }`
   - `reasoning`: `{ kind: "reasoning", text: str }`
   - `source`: `{ kind: "source", id: str, title: str, filename: str | None, media_type: str }`
