"Test: `ChatAttachment` now has `id: str`, `content_type: str`, `size: int | None`, `text: str | None`, `data_url: str | None`. `ChatMessage` has `id: str`, `parent_id: str | None`, `parts: list[ChatPart]`."

So `ChatAttachment` has: `id: str`, `content_type: str`, `size: int | None`, `text: str | None`, `data_url: str | None`. Note: NO `name` field! The TS version has `name` but the brief doesn't mention it. Hmm.

